        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-273 (ensure controlled execution — Project Sales &amp; B2B (PA-11.2).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: AR Clerk</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
