    <bpmn:process id="W_W228" name="W228. Sales Commission Calculation (Trade &amp; Project Sales)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly sales commission cycle (after month-end close and collection confirmation)
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: ~5 HQ Trade Account Managers (per §3.3) supported by store-based Sales Associates
Owner: Sales Operations Manager
Participants: Sales Operations, Finance (Payroll), HR, Head of Trade / Account Management, Sales Reps
Source: workflow W228 — Sales Commission Calculation (Trade &amp; Project Sales)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W228_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W228_Lane1" name="Sales Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W228_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W228_Start7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W228_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W228_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W228_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W228_Lane3" name="Sales Ops Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W228_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W228_Lane4" name="Sales Reps">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W228_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W228_Lane5" name="Payroll Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W228_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W228_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W228_Start7" name="Monthly sales commission cycle (after month-end close and collection confirmation)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W228_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W228_Task8" name="Data Pull">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Data Pull: Sales Operations pulls monthly sales and collections report by Sales Rep / Account Manager from ERP. Commission is calculated based on realized collections (paid invoices), not just invoiced sales, to mitigate bad debt risk (W108).
Responsible (R): Sales Operations
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W228_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W228_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W228_Task9" name="Tiered Calculation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Tiered Calculation: System applies tiered commission rates based on individual margin performance (higher margin items earn higher commission rates) and target achievement (e.g. 80-99% target gets standard commission, 100%+ gets accelerator).
Responsible (R): System / Sales Ops
Accountable (A): Sales Ops Mgr
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W228_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W228_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W228_Task10" name="Deductions &amp; Adjustments">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Deductions &amp; Adjustments: System deducts returns (W12) or credit notes issued against original sales of the rep, and adjusts for any shared commission deals between reps.
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Sales Ops Mgr
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W228_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W228_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W228_Task11" name="Review &amp; Approval">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Review &amp; Approval: Sales Operations generates commission sheets; routes to Head of Trade / Account Management and CFO for approval.
Responsible (R): Sales Ops Mgr
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W228_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W228_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W228_Task12" name="Dispute Window">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Dispute Window: Approved sheets published to Sales Reps via portal/email; 3-day window for reps to raise disputes or missing deal inquiries.
Responsible (R): Sales Reps
Accountable (A): Sales Ops Mgr
Duration: 3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W228_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W228_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W228_Task13" name="Payroll Integration">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Payroll Integration: Final commission figures approved and pushed to HR/Payroll module (W10) for inclusion in the mid-month payroll run.
Responsible (R): Payroll Clerk
Accountable (A): HR Manager
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W228_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W228_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W228_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W228_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W228_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-273 (ensure controlled execution — Project Sales &amp; B2B (PA-11.2).) | - operational: handles splits but does not capture the rationale behind non-standard split percentages
Owner: Sales Operations Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
