    <bpmn:process id="W_W1161" name="W1161. Customer B2B Annual Volume Rebate Tier Qualification Tracking &amp; Earned Benefit Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly B2B account review, or customer inquiry about rebate status, or annual rebate settlement cycle
Frequency: Monthly tracking for ~5,200 trade accounts; annual settlement for qualifying accounts
Volume: ~1,000–1,500 accounts qualifying for annual volume rebates
Owner: Trade Account Manager (HQ)
Participants: Trade Account Manager, Finance Analyst, Customer (Trade Account Purchasing Manager)
Source: workflow W1161 — Customer B2B Annual Volume Rebate Tier Qualification Tracking &amp; Earned Benefit Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1161_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1161_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1161_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1161_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1161_Lane2" name="Finance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1161_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1161_Lane3" name="Trade Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1161_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1161_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1161_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1161_Start5" name="Monthly B2B account review, or customer inquiry about rebate status, or annual rebate…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1161_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1161_Task6" name="Monthly Volume Tracking &amp; Tier Progress Communication">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monthly Volume Tracking &amp; Tier Progress Communication: (a) system calculates cumulative annual spend per trade account (January–current month): gross purchase value minus returns, excluding VAT, excluding non-qualifying categories (services, gift cards); (b) system determines current rebate tier and progress toward next tier: &quot;Customer ABC Construction: YTD spend PHP 2.4M (Silver tier). PHP 600K to Gold tier (2% rebate). At current pace, you will qualify by September.&quot;; (c) monthly statement sent to customer (per W1117 auto-generation): purchases, returns, net spend, current tier, progress bar; (d) customers approaching tier threshold within 3 months receive proactive communication from Trade Account Manager with incentive: &quot;You&#x27;re PHP 200K from Gold tier — qualifying purchases this month could earn you an additional PHP 50K year-end rebate&quot;
Responsible (R): System / Trade Account Manager
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Automated + 1–2 hours/month for proactive outreach</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1161_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1161_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1161_Task7" name="Year-End Rebate Calculation &amp; Verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Year-End Rebate Calculation &amp; Verification: (a) in January (following performance year), finance analyst runs the annual rebate calculation in Oracle Incentive Compensation on the W3322 trade-incentive plan spine (the H14 vehicle): final cumulative spend per account, qualifying tier, rebate percentage, rebate amount (= cumulative spend × rebate %); (b) reconciliation adjustments: subtract returns processed after year-end but related to prior year purchases, subtract any disputed or voided transactions, add late-processed invoices from prior year; (c) rebate calculation audited by internal audit team per W337 (payroll &amp; statutory compliance audit methodology applied to rebate program); (d) finalized rebate register generated: all qualifying accounts, tiers, and amounts
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst / System
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1–2 weeks in January</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1161_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1161_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1161_Task8" name="Rebate Settlement &amp; Customer Communication">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Rebate Settlement &amp; Customer Communication: (a) customer notified of earned rebate amount via email and B2B portal (W936): &quot;Your 2025 annual volume rebate: PHP 48,000 (Gold tier, 2% on PHP 2.4M net spend)&quot;; (b) customer selects rebate settlement method: credit note applied to AR account (reduces outstanding balance), loyalty points (rebate amount ÷ PHP 100 = points added to loyalty account per W17), store credit (for future purchases), or check payment (for amounts &gt; PHP 100K); (c) settlement processed in ERP with BIR-compliant documentation (credit note per W540 if applicable); (d) rebate settlement deadline: February 28 — unclaimed rebates forfeited and converted to loyalty points automatically
Responsible (R): Trade Account Manager / System
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: 3–5 min per account</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1161_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1161_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1161_Task9" name="Rebate Program Performance Analysis">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Rebate Program Performance Analysis: (a) annual rebate program analysis: total rebate expense, number of accounts per tier, tier migration (how many moved up/down), average rebate per account, rebate as % of gross margin; (b) ROI analysis: did rebate program drive incremental volume? Compare rebate cost vs. estimated incremental gross margin from increased purchasing; (c) tier threshold review: are thresholds set appropriately? (Too high → few qualify, low motivation; too low → excessive rebate cost); (d) recommendations for next year&#x27;s rebate structure presented to executive team in Q1 strategic review
Responsible (R): Trade Account Manager / Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management / CFO
Duration: 1–2 days/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1161_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1161_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1161_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1161_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1161_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-273 (ensure controlled execution — Project Sales &amp; B2B (PA-11.2).) | - operational: Trade Account Manager review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Trade Account Manager (HQ)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1161_Assoc12" sourceRef="W1161_Annotation11" targetRef="W1161_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1161_Flow13" sourceRef="W1161_Start5" targetRef="W1161_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1161_Flow14" sourceRef="W1161_Task6" targetRef="W1161_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1161_Flow15" sourceRef="W1161_Task7" targetRef="W1161_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1161_Flow16" sourceRef="W1161_Task8" targetRef="W1161_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1161_Flow17" sourceRef="W1161_Task9" targetRef="W1161_End10" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W1161_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W1161_plane" bpmnElement="W_W1161">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1161_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W1161_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1160" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1161_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W1161_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="1160" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1161_Lane3_di" bpmnElement="W1161_Lane3" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="420" width="1160" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1161_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W1161_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1161_Task7_di" bpmnElement="W1161_Task7"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
